        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Darkness &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Shadow Mantle</p><p><em>The plate stops returning light. Edges become genuinely hard to locate.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Darkvision.</strong> +1 item bonus to Stealth in dim light or darkness.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Once per day, create a 20-foot emanation of <strong>magical darkness</strong> for 1 minute. You see through it normally.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>In dim light or darkness you may <strong>Hide and Sneak without cover or concealment</strong>, and gain +1 circumstance to AC.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Once per round, as a single action, <strong>teleport between two areas of darkness</strong> within 60 feet.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
